# MO-009: Filtration can remove scattering without removing dissolved colour
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 H2SO4 0.001mol
add v1 CuSO4 0.001mol
add v1 SiO2 0.1g
stir v1 300rpm 5s
measure v1 eyes
measure v1 uvvis
inspect v1
new
filter v1 v2
measure v2 eyes
measure v2 uvvis
inspect
